POLICIES OF THE SECOND HOKAGE
Tobirama Senju, Nidaime Hokage — Administrative Record

Brother of the First Hokage, Tobirama Senju formalized the
institutions that still structure the village:

- Establishment of the ANBU (special operations, answering directly
  to the Hokage).
- Founding of the Konoha Military Police Force, entrusted to the
  Uchiha clan for internal law enforcement.
- Creation of the Academy system to standardize shinobi training.
- Codification of the Chunin Exam framework held between allied
  villages.

Tobirama was a master of Water Release capable of forming water
without a source, and the originator of the Flying Thunder God
Technique and the forbidden Impure World Reincarnation. He fell in
battle during the First Shinobi World War, naming Hiruzen Sarutobi
as his successor. His administrative reforms endure.
